      "text": "We will let user upload medias straight into aws.\nFlow: \n1. user-> request upload -> backend -> save\nmedia ids -> request singed urls -> return to\nuser\n2. user -> upload to aws -> aws event trigger\nbackend -> erase it self from watch list -> after\nI*30s + v*60 s -> if watch list exists -> raise\nerror  ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "nt8TfvwJ90Mh-qmHr1E2l",
      "originalText": "We will let user upload medias straight into aws. \nFlow: \n1. user-> request upload -> backend -> save media ids -> request singed urls -> return to user\n2. user -> upload to aws -> aws event trigger backend -> erase it self from watch list -> after I*30s + v*60 s -> if watch list exists -> raise error  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
